{"articleNo":"191237","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=191237&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[국제] 2018 경상북도 대학생 새마을 해외봉사단 모집 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.04.09","hit":"4095","attachments":[{"name":"주민등록초본 발급 예시(필수열람).jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=191237&attachNo=78064"},{"name":"붙임. 2018 도 대학생 새마을 해외봉사단 모집 공고문 1부(최종).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=191237&attachNo=79257"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\" class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2018</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 경상북도 대학생 새마을 해외봉사단 모집 공고</span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">비영리 공익재단인 새마을세계화재단은 새마을운동을 통한 개발도상국 농촌발전과 빈곤종식을 위해 </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">10</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개국 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">37</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">개 마을에서 새마을 시범마을 조성사업을 추진하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">새마을세계화사업 현장에서 새마을운동과 경상북도의 위상을 널리 알릴 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2018 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">경상북도 대학생 새마을 해외봉사단을 아래와 같이 모집하오니 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">선발인원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 00</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명 </span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">파견국가 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">베트남</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">짝포 마을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">), </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">인도네시아</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">딴중왕이 마을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">파견기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 2018.7.16.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) ~ 7.27.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) / 11</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">박 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">12</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공고 및 원서접수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 2018.4.9.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) ~ 4.29.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">참가비 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">인당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">10</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">만원 (추가 부담금 없음. 항공비, 여행자 보험, 현지 숙박비 등 새마을세계화재단에서 부담)</span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><font size=\"1\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; ※</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국민기초생활보장법</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에 따른 수급자 및 차상위계층</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">한부모가족지원법</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에 </span></font></font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><font size=\"1\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 따른 보호대상자의 경우 참가비 면제</span></font></font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">접수방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span>재단 홈페이지 온라인 접수(saemaulgf.or.kr)</span></span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">7. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기타사항</span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">인터넷 민원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">24</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에서 주민등록초본 발급 예시를 첨부파일로 올리니 필히 열람하시</span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"돋음\"><font size=\"2\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기타 자세한 사항은 첨부된 공고문을 참고해주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">.</span></span></font></font></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
